"couple.hero.formal\" data-interim=\"true\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%221152%22%20height%3D%22629%22%2F%3E\" width=\"745\" height=\"407\" alt=\"Generated portrait of Sara and Tyler cheek to cheek on a bridge at dusk, city lights glowing behind them.\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\" fetchpriority=\"high\" style=\"object-position:46% 40%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></div><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--hero-left\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/corner-tl-138.webp\" width=\"138\" height=\"278\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.corner-tl\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><div class=\"bd-hero__copy\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow bd-hero__kicker\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are getting married</span></p><h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"bd-hero__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Sara</span><span class=\"bd-plus\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\"> + </span></span><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Tyler</span></h1><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-hero__lede\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Welcome to our wedding website. If you are one of our guests, sign in to reserve your room and start planning your trip.</span></span></p><div class=\"bd-hero__actions\"><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--primary\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Book your hotel room</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--secondary\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bd-theme\" aria-labelledby=\"theme-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Rooted in love. Surrounded by peace. Filled with\"><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--theme\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/edge-left-tall-88.webp\" width=\"88\" height=\"326\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.edge-left-tall\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><div class=\"bd-theme__inner\"><div class=\"bd-theme__intro\"><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-theme__title\" id=\"theme-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Rooted in love. Surrounded by peace. Filled with happiness.</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We're so happy you're here! We believe life's greatest joys are found in the people we love, the moments we share, and the memories we make along the way.</span></p><p class=\"bd-theme__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We hope our wedding is a reflection of these things and a chance to slow down, be present, and celebrate the happiness that comes from being together. We’re so grateful to have you in our lives.</span></p><p class=\"bd-theme__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">With love,</span><br><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara &amp; Tyler</span></p></div><ol class=\"bd-theme__list\"><li class=\"bd-theme__item\" data-reveal=\"\"><h3 class=\"bd-theme__word\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love</span></h3><span class=\"bd-theme__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Every one of you is part of how we got here. This celebration is as much about you as it is about us.</span></p></li><li class=\"bd-theme__item\" data-reveal=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><h3 class=\"bd-theme__word\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Peace</span></h3><span class=\"bd-theme__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">No rush and no guesswork: a chance to slow down, catch up and simply be together.</span></p></li><li class=\"bd-theme__item\" data-reveal=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><h3 class=\"bd-theme__word\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Happiness</span></h3><span class=\"bd-theme__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-theme__line\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The places and moments that made us happy, shared with the people we love.</span></p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"bd-share\" aria-labelledby=\"share-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What we can’t wait to share\"><header class=\"bd-share__head\" data-reveal=\"\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"What we can’t wait to share\"><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-share__title\" id=\"share-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What we can’t wait to share</span></h2></header><article class=\"bd-share__item bd-share__item--story\" id=\"our-story\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How it all started\"><figure class=\"bd-share__photo\" data-reveal=\"photo\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture data-media=\"couple.story.monochrome\" data-interim=\"true\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22665%22%20height%3D%22476%22%2F%3E\" width=\"301\" height=\"216\" alt=\"Generated black-and-white portrait: Sara looking up at Tyler, both smiling.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:55% 40%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></figure><div class=\"bd-share__body\" data-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our story</span></p><h3 class=\"bd-share__name bd-italic\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How it all started</span></h3><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We met at a friend’s wedding, where an evening of talking, playing games, and getting to know each other became the start of our story.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Read our story</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"bd-share__item bd-share__item--venue\" id=\"adventures\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"The places we have been\"><figure class=\"bd-share__photo\" data-reveal=\"photo\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"figure\"><picture data-media=\"place.starved-rock\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22512%22%20height%3D%22341%22%2F%3E\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" alt=\"French Canyon at Starved Rock State Park: a narrow sandstone gorge between moss-covered walls.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:45% 50%\" data-bl-m=\"photo\"></picture></figure><div class=\"bd-share__body\" data-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Our adventures</span></p><h3 class=\"bd-share__name bd-italic\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The places we have been</span></h3><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">A map of where we have been together, each place with what Sara remembers and what Tyler remembers.</span></p><a class=\"bd-more\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">See our adventures</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></div></article></section><section class=\"bd-closing\" aria-labelledby=\"closing-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Everything for the weekend is inside\"><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--closing\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/cluster-tl-152.webp\" width=\"152\" height=\"232\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.cluster-tl\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><div class=\"bd-closing__text\" data-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Invited guests</span></p><h2 class=\"bd-h bd-h--2 bd-closing__title\" id=\"closing-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Everything for the weekend is inside</span></h2><p><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sign in with the email or mobile number we have for you. No password: we send a six-digit code. Inside is the date, the place, and what to do next.</span></span></p><p><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--primary\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Book your hotel room</span></span><svg class=\"bd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 10\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M0 5H18M14 1L18 5L14 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></a></p></div></section></main><nav class=\"bd-bar\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:2\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Quick actions\"><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 5h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4zM20 5h-7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Story</span></span></a><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/our-adventures\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zM15 9l-2 6-4 2 2-6z\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Adventures</span></span></a></nav><footer class=\"bd-footer\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"f